fpath 2858
accept 580
tip Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog: its bottles are on the Hinterlands beaches (a later guide), and it is handed in back here in the Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50) guide.
turnin 95295
accept 95322
turnin 1118
tip Bring Kravel's Scheme with you.
