# North: the crocolisks, Nesingwary's camp, the Venture Co., Bhag'thera and the Mosh'Ogg ogres ----------------

do 628
tip The Elder Saltwater Crocolisks are level 38 elites on the coast north of Grom'gol.
accept 338 339 340 341 342
accept 193
tip Barnil Stonepot, Hemet Nesingwary and Sir S. J. Erlgadin stand together in the hunters' camp.
do 339 340 341 342 bg
tip Every page you loot or buy counts; you hand in the chapters on your way back.
turnin 95325
tip The ledger is upstairs in the Venture Co. building by the lake.
accept 95326
do 95326
tip The agent waits inside the building.
do 193
tip Bhag'thera, a level 40 elite panther, prowls the hills between the lake and the Mosh'Ogg mound.
do 613
tip Every Mosh'Ogg ogre can drop the key; the lords and the butchers most often.
do 591
tip Mai'Zoth, a level 47 elite ogre, stands on top of the Mosh'Ogg mound.

